  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Salt of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Pb</mi><msub><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>OH</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mi>COOH</mi></math><br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Weak base&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Weak acid</p><p><br />Salt of<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>&#8201;&#8201;&#8201;</mtext><mi>Al</mi><msub><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>OH</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>HCN</mi></math><br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Weak base&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;Weak acid</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Salt of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Fe</mi><msub><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>OH</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>HCl</mi></math><br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; Weak base&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;Strong acid<br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/266699_1.jpg\" style=\"width: 370px; height: 54px;\" /><br /><br />Hence, the nature of the solution is basic.</p>",
